  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "EngineEventManager serves as the central service layer for capturing and standardizing all raw input events from the browser, including mouse, keyboard, gamepad, and pointer interactions. It initializes listeners on the canvas and document, translating DOM events into engine-consumable state changes for core systems. Its primary role is bridging the browser's event system with the core game loop logic, managing input state updates during the engine's update cycle."
  },
